    <edge source="Conditional Licence" target="Hearing Aid">
      <data key="d7">2.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The inability to meet standard driving requirements with a hearing aid does not disqualify a person from obtaining a conditional licence.&lt;SEP&gt;The standard for a conditional license is evaluated to determine if it can be met with the use of a hearing aid.</data>
      <data key="d9">assessment,driving,eligibility,fitness,standard</data>
