      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
    <edge source="Conditional Licence" target="ENT Specialist">
      <data key="d7">3.0</data>
      <data key="d8">An ENT specialist may conduct an individualized assessment to determine a person's eligibility for a conditional licence.&lt;SEP&gt;An ENT specialist provides information regarding the nature of driving tasks and hearing conditions relevant to the license.&lt;SEP&gt;Information provided by an ENT specialist is taken into account when considering a conditional licence.</data>
      <data key="d9">assessment,assessment input,eligibility,information,medical opinion,specialist</data>
