    <edge source="Conditional Licence" target="Practical Driver Assessment">
      <data key="d7">2.0</data>
      <data key="d8">A practical driver assessment may be required, and the resulting report can advise on assistive technologies as a licence condition.&lt;SEP&gt;A practical driver assessment may be required as part of the conditional license process if further individualized assessment is needed.</data>
      <data key="d9">assistive technologies,evaluation,report,required,requirement</data>
      <data key="d10">AFTD2022-EXP-e3e1cd7604e64e7e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-HEAR-COM-003-chunk-000</data>
