    <edge source="Section 4.2" target="General Assessment and Management Guidelines">
      <data key="d7">1.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Section 4.2 contains general assessment and management guidelines referenced for both ENT specialists and audiologists regarding hearing aid usage.</data>
